hypeForge (patch 4, 2026-10-27): the title bar background in as many pieces as its texts cut it into

Sway makes five background pieces up front; a title and the three buttons (patch 1) cut it into
seven, and the pieces past the fifth were never drawn: a see-through strip under the title bar
and right of the close button. Javier: "there is like a transparent border inside the top of the
window". Bench: scripts/titlebar-paint-bench.py.

--- a/sway/tree/container.c	2026-10-20 22:17:32.030947447 -0400
+++ b/sway/tree/container.c	2026-10-27 19:22:44.138644872 -0400
